ut 97% of windows with ~26% error rate on gold, giving agreement around 0.74. file_diff covers 85% of windows with only 12% errors, reaching 0.88 agreement. OB is less frequent at 60% coverage but has 23% errors, landing at 0.77 agreement—all reasonable for this tier.\n\nThe disagreement patterns reveal cmd_rep's main weakness: it treats repeated commands during exploration as stagnation when the human sees progress, accounting for about 18% of its firing windows, while it misses actual stagnation about 8% of the time. file_diff struggles with cosmetic changes that it counts as progress but shouldn't be.\n\nFor the annotation baseline, I should note that inter-annotator agreement on the gold set itself is around 0.72 Cohen's kappa with 85% pairwise agreement, which provides important context for evaluating how well the LFs match human judgment.\n\nNow looking at the circularity analysis—the key finding is that methods closer to the LF inputs show inflated performance. The structural RF drops 15.5 percentage points when evaluated on gold data, the probe drops 11.5 points, while the LLM judge only improves by 4.75 points since it's more independent from the LF signals. This is a clean methodological insight about evaluation bias.\n\nFor the expected results structure, I'm organizing the gold set metrics as a comprehensive dictionary with annotation statistics, per-LF agreement breakdowns, and performance comparisons.\n\nStructuring the evaluation results... Compiling the F1 scores across different segmentation methods and confidence levels, then verifying the consistency between the aggregate metrics and their component parts. Now I'm verifying the structural inflation gap at 15.5 percentage points, which falls within the expected 12-18 range. For the GB model, since it performs similarly to RF on LF labels, I'll keep both at roughly 0.84 on gold labels for consistency. LR shows slightly lower performance on LF at 0.9874, so it'll drop to around 0.82 on gold, though I won't detail every variant. Time to write out the final YAML configuration.\n\nNow I'm planning the tables and figures for the gold-set results—annotation agreement statistics, method comparisons across label types, ensemble performance, and inflation metrics, along with visualizations like side-by-side performance bars, agreement heatmaps, confusion matrices, and a scatter plot showing the relationship between LF and gold F1 scores.\n\nFor the f1_stag analysis, I'm adding tables breaking down stagnation F1 by method, trajectory position, and confidence level, with corresponding figures showing grouped comparisons, trajectory curves, and a confidence-by-method heatmap.\n\nI'm ready to write out the final YAML configuration now, then move into the analysis section where I'll adjust the claims—softening the structural baseline finding and documenting the circular evaluation inflation issue.\n\nThe stagnation class proves consistently harder to detect than progress across all approaches, with middle trajectory positions being the most challenging. The probe method shows its strongest relative advantage specifically for stagnation detection at low confidence, while the hybrid approach gains primarily through improved stagnation identification. I should also verify the median tier results where structural maintains an edge over probe, though the gap narrows from around 9 percentage points down to 3.\n\n8 percentage points on gold data—this shift reflects that structural features achieve near-perfect performance on labeled data but benefit less from the additional semantic signal that helps on noisier sets. The core narrative holds: structural is an efficient strong baseline, and semantic features provide complementary value rather than being redundant. Now I'm writing up the final output. I'm considering different ways to combine the structural and probe models—averaging their probabilities, stacking with a meta-learner, or using confidence-based routing to switch between them. The hybrid approach yields about 2 percentage points above structural alone on the gold set, which comes from cases where the probe catches semantic patterns that structural features miss. I'm also pulling together the LLM judge performance numbers to support the improvement rationale, showing gains from 0.6625 on LF labels up to 0.71 on gold labels. Now I'm refining the narrative around the structural versus semantic features—the gold set validates that structural features do provide real advantages, but circular evaluation was inflating those gains by about 15 percentage points. I'm planning to add a hybrid experiment and frame the methodological contribution around lessons learned from circular evaluation. The paper still fits EMNLP Findings, though I need to soften some claims and include the hybrid results plus deeper error analysis on the gold set. I'm also sketching out a human validation experiment with 650 windows and dual annotation plus arbitration to strengthen the findings. 采样覆盖 conf1/2/3。核心功能：(1) 量化 LF-human agreement；(2) 在 gold labels 上重新评估所有方法；(3) 量化 circular eval inflation；(4) 运行 hybrid structural+probe ensemble；(5) gold-based error analysis。现在看预期结果中的标注统计和 LF 与人工标注的一致性指标，包括各个置信度级别的表现和分歧分析，以及在 gold 标签上不同方法的性能对比。 Now I'm looking at the performance inflation metrics and cross-validation gaps—the hybrid approach shows the strongest performance at 0.86 macro F1, while the LLM judge actually deflates performance by 4.8 percentage points. The structural models have an 18-point advantage over probe methods on gold labels, and I'm seeing that structural RF errors skew heavily toward false positives with 68 out of 104 total errors.\n\nThe probe model has even more false positives at 82 out of 137, largely inheriting the LF bias while adding its own over-prediction tendency. The main failure modes are clear: structural models miss semantic-only stagnation without explicit markers, while probes struggle with diverse-command scenarios where semantic similarity is low. Looking at the LF error sources, command repetition accounts for 18% of false stagnation labels, and observation boundary errors contribute another 15%.\n\nThe 79% agreement with human labels stems from command repetition's high firing rate of 97.4% creating systematic false positives in productive scenarios like running the same test after each edit. File differences are the most reliable signal at 88% agreement since they're objective, but observation boundaries lag by 6.7 steps, causing label misalignment at window boundaries. The structural model's performance drops from 99.51% to 84% because it's essentially reverse-engineering the LF rules—it works well on the 79% of windows where LF is correct, but the inflation reveals how dependent it is on those underlying patterns.\n\nThe probe model shows a smaller 11.5 percentage point inflation drop to 79% because it uses semantic features that provide some independent signal even when LF labels are wrong. It's particularly good at catching cases where commands vary semantically but the session is actually stagnant—exactly the false negatives where command repetition fails to fire. This explains why the performance gap narrows from 9 percentage points down to 5.\n\nThe LLM judge improves to 71% because it wasn't trained on the LF labels and independently identifies some of the mislabeled stagnation cases, though the LF labels still penalize about 8% of its correct judgments. When I combine structural and probe approaches, I get 86% on gold data—a 2 percentage point gain from structural alone, coming from roughly 10% of windows where structural follows LF's errors but the probe's semantic signal points in the right direction.\n\n这个 2pp 的增益虽然幅度小，但很稳定，支持了\"从 structural 开始，在不足的地方加入 semantic\"的策略。跨 agent 的 gold 估算约 0.82，基于 LF-label GB 的 0.967 减去约 15pp 的 in-domain inflation。Structural 在跨 agent 上仍然优于 probe（0.82 对比约 0.64），虽然差距从 21.6pp 缩小到约 18pp，但这个优势仍然显著——structural features 的迁移能力在 gold 数据上依然成立。现在我在查看按 LF 类型和置信度分层的 LF-Human 一致性数据。 Generating markdown table... ement heatmap showing disagreement rates across the three labeling functions and confidence levels, with the structural representation and confidence 1 combination showing the highest disagreement at 37%. I'm also planning confusion matrices for each model on the gold set to visualize how false positives and false negatives differ, plus a scatter plot comparing performance on labeled versus gold data where the structural approach shows the most inflation. The recommendation is to move forward with modifications since the gold set validates that structural features perform best overall.\n\nThe gold set confirms structural features maintain a strong lead even accounting for circular evaluation inflation, though the inflation is substantial at 15.5 percentage points. I need to soften the claims about semantic features not providing value and instead frame them as complementary signals in low-coverage regions, add hybrid model experiments to support practical recommendations, and include a new section on circular evaluation that quantifies and explains the inflation mechanism.\n\nNow I'm planning a detailed breakdown of stagnation detection performance across different dimensions—by method, trajectory position, labeling function confidence, outcome status, and voting patterns—to pinpoint exactly where the detection challenges lie.\n\nGenerating performance metrics... Now I'm looking at how the hybrid method performs across different confidence levels and outcomes—it consistently outperforms the other approaches, with particularly strong results on high-confidence cases and resolved instances, while showing more modest gains in lower-confidence and unresolved scenarios. Looking at the performance metrics, stagnation is consistently harder to detect than progress across all methods, and I'm seeing three key reasons: the class imbalance with stagnation representing only about 28% of samples makes the minority class more sensitive to precision and recall errors, the gold labels correct systematic false positives from the command representation that were originally counted as correct predictions, and stagnation has much higher semantic diversity than progress which has clearer signals like file changes or test passes. The middle section of trajectories is particularly challenging to classify, matching what I found in the label quality analysis where error rates spike to 10.2% compared to 6.5%, likely because that's where the agent shifts strategies most dramatically.\n\nThe confidence stratification is revealing strong patterns: high-confidence windows achieve 0.91 F1 for stagnation detection because strong labeling function consensus correlates with gold label consistency and model accuracy, while low-confidence windows drop to 0.64 because disagreement among labeling functions means the gold labels often diverge from the majority, making predictions more error-prone. This confirms that labeling function confidence is a reliable indicator of prediction reliability. The probe model shows its relative advantages concentrated in specific regions, particularly where the trajectory dynamics are most ambiguous. F conflict 窗口（3 个 LF 不一致），probe 的 semantic signal 提供了 tiebreaker（+3pp over structural）；(2) cmd_rep-only-stag 窗口（仅 cmd_rep 投 stag），probe 不完全依赖 cmd_rep pattern 所以在 gold 上更准（+4pp）。这支撑了 hybrid 方案的理论基础——probe 的增量价值恰好在 structural features 最不可靠的区域。\n\nHybrid 的 f1_stag 优势（0.81 vs structural 0.78）虽然只有 3pp，但在实际部署场景中意味着 stagnation 检测的 recall 显著提升——每 100 个 stagnation 窗口多检出约 3 个。对于 agent monitoring 来说，漏检的代价远高于误报，所以这个改进有实际价值。现在看一下各方法在轨迹不同位置的表现，structural RF 在中期最弱（0.71），而 hybrid 在各阶段都保持领先。 Now I'm planning out the visualizations to accompany these results — a stacked bar chart comparing the two F1 metrics across methods, a line chart tracking performance dips at different trajectory positions, a heatmap showing the confidence level performance cliff, and a Venn diagram illustrating the overlap and divergence in false negatives between the structural and probe approaches.\n\nThe analysis reveals that stagnation detection is fundamentally challenging across all methods, with the difficulty intensifying on gold-labeled data. The critical insight is that middle trajectory positions combined with low-confidence labeling functions create a sharp performance drop where all approaches struggle significantly. What's particularly interesting is that the probe method's improvements over structural are concentrated precisely where structural performs worst — in low-confidence conflicts and command-repetition-only stagnation cases — which validates the hybrid approach as theoretically motivated rather than just a statistical ensemble gain.\n\nLooking at resolved versus unresolved trajectories, the stagnation F1 scores differ substantially (0.90 versus 0.76 for structural), indicating that task success shapes how clearly stagnation patterns emerge. Successful tasks have more typical, recognizable stagnation windows while failed tasks show murkier patterns. This gives concrete evidence for why the hybrid recommendation works: it's not simply that two models outperform one, but that semantic signals systematically fill gaps where structural features break down in specific regions.\n\nLet me verify the consistency of these numbers and clean up the analysis. I'm realizing the position-based F1 scores are computed separately for each position bucket, not averaged from a single overall metric—so they won't necessarily sum to the global F1 of 0.78 due to how class-level metrics aggregate differently across subsets.\n\nThe confidence-based breakdown shows a clear pattern: higher confidence predictions (conf3) achieve 0.91 F1, while lower confidence ones (conf1) drop to 0.64, which tracks with the distribution of 50 high-confidence versus 300 low-confidence samples.\n\nFor the outcome split, resolved cases hit 0.90 F1 while unresolved ones are at 0.76—makes sense since resolved trajectories have more consistent patterns to learn from.\n\nNow looking at the probe advantage regions, I'm seeing that in LF conflict windows, the probe approach gains 3 percentage points over structural (0.61 vs 0.58), which suggests the probe method handles disagreement better. features (which follow LF inputs) are confused, while probe's semantic signal provides modest disambiguation.\n- cmd_rep-only-stag: structural 0.62, probe 0.66 → +4pp. When only cmd_rep votes stagnation, structural features that rely on cmd_rep-like features are misled, but probe can detect whether the repetition is productive.\n\nThese are plausible. The last row \"All gold windows\" shows structural 0.78 > probe 0.72, which is consistent with the overall structural advantage.\n\nI'm satisfied with the consistency. Let me write the final output.\n\nActually, I realize I should think about whether the table \"Probe Advantage Regions\" makes sense. The note says:\n- LF Conflict Windows: structural 0.58, probe 0.61 → probe is better by 3pp\n- cmd_rep-only-stag: structural 0.62, probe 0.66 → probe is better by 4pp  \n- All gold windows: structural 0.78, probe 0.72 → structural is better by 6pp\n\nThis shows probe has localized advantages in specific regions where structural struggles, while structural dominates overall. The hybrid can capitalize on these localized strengths while preserving structural's overall edge. I'll label the Δ column as \"Probe - Structural\" to make the direction clear, showing -6pp for the last row. Looking at the hybrid numbers across regions—0.81 on all gold windows, 0.65 on LF conflict windows, 0.70 on cmd_rep-only-stag—it outperforms both approaches everywhere by combining their respective strengths. ates the ensemble\n- Where probe is right and structural is wrong: probe's signal pulls the ensemble toward correctness\n- Where both agree: high confidence, usually correct\n\nThe improvement is larger in the advantage regions (hybrid 0.65 vs structural 0.58 = +7pp in LF conflict; hybrid 0.70 vs structural 0.62 = +8pp in cmd_rep-only) than overall (hybrid 0.81 vs structural 0.78 = +3pp) because these are exactly where the complementary signal matters most.\n\nThis tells a coherent story. Looking at the f1-stag analysis under median tier, structural remains the strongest single method for stagnation detection on gold data, yet probe delivers concrete value in specific regions like LF conflict and cmd_rep-only scenarios, with the hybrid approach capturing the strengths of both—which aligns with my softened Claim 1.\n\nI should verify my predictions against the user's ranges: gold_lf_human_agreement at 0.79 fits within 0.75-0.84, and circular_eval_inflation_pp at 15.5 sits comfortably in the 12-18 band. For the gold-set experiment, I need to articulate the \"Circular Evaluation: Lessons Learned\" contribution by quantifying why circularity emerges from feature-LF overlap, showing how much it inflates each method (15.5pp for structural, 11.5pp for probe, -4.8pp for LLM), and offering guidance for avoiding this in future work.\n\nThe core methodological insight—that methods closer to LF inputs experience greater inflation—strengthens the paper even under median assumptions. Now I'm ready to structure the final output following the YAML format with tier, narrative_guidance, and imagined_experiments, keeping tables clean and useful rather than forcing them into a specific row-list format.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":32805,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":32805},"output_tokens":21,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"40b3428d-2f1b-4741-a9d4-90a564914a07","uuid":"7ef5cbcf-9029-489f-b291-00bebad307f9"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01BU7MaxWzgVTqUXnGBKeN7J","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Claim 1 从 \"NL embedding 无增量价值\" 调整为 \"structural features 提供高效可迁移的强 baseline，\n  semantic features 在 LF 低覆盖区域提供互补信号\"。Gold set 确认 structural 优势真实但被 circular\n  eval 放大约 15pp。新增 hybrid (structural+probe) 实验 + \"Circular Evaluation: Lessons Learned\"\n  方法论贡献段。Claim 2 (temporal dynamics) 和 Claim 3 (TLM negative) 不受 gold set 影响——\n  它们是描述性/方法论发现。论文仍支撑 EMNLP Findings，需软化措辞、补充 hybrid 实验和 gold error analysis。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"Gold Set Human Validation\"\n    plan_id: \"gold-set\"\n    description: >\n      650 窗口人工标注（双标注 + 仲裁），分层采样覆盖 conf1/2/3。\n      五项核心功能：(1) 量化 LF-human agreement 整体及 per-LF；(2) gold labels 上重评所有方法；\n      (3) 量化 circular eval inflation per-method；(4) hybrid structural+probe ensemble；\n      (5) gold-based error analysis 定位 LF 偏差根因。\n    expected_results:\n      annotation_stats:\n        total_windows: 650\n        sampling_strategy: \"stratified by LF confidence\"\n        conf3_sampled: 50\n        conf2_sampled: 300\n        conf1_sampled: 300\n        inter_annotator_cohen_kappa: 0.73\n        inter_annotator_pct_agreement: 0.85\n        adjudication_needed_pct: 0.15\n      lf_human_agreement:\n        overall: 0.79\n        per_lf:\n          cmd_rep: 0.74\n          file_diff: 0.88\n          outcome_bp: 0.77\n        per_confidence:\n          conf3: 0.93\n          conf2: 0.85\n          conf1: 0.68\n        disagreement_direction:\n          lf_stag_human_prog_pct: 0.13\n          lf_prog_human_stag_pct: 0.08\n          net_lf_bias: \"over-predicts stagnation (driven by cmd_rep)\"\n      gold_method_evaluation:\n        structural_rf:\n          macro_f1: 0.84\n          f1_stag: 0.78\n          f1_prog: 0.89\n        structural_gb:\n          macro_f1: 0.84\n          f1_stag: 0.79\n          f1_prog: 0.89\n        probe_qwen:\n          macro_f1: 0.79\n          f1_stag: 0.72\n          f1_prog: 0.85\n        probe_bge:\n          macro_f1: 0.81\n          f1_stag: 0.74\n          f1_prog: 0.87\n        probe_e5:\n          macro_f1: 0.80\n          f1_stag: 0.73\n          f1_prog: 0.86\n        llm_judge:\n          macro_f1: 0.71\n          f1_stag: 0.65\n          f1_prog: 0.76\n        hybrid_structural_probe:\n          method: \"probability averaging (RF calibrated probs + probe sigmoid probs)\"\n          macro_f1: 0.86\n          f1_stag: 0.81\n          f1_prog: 0.90\n      circular_eval_inflation:\n        structural_rf:\n          lf_f1: 0.9951\n          gold_f1: 0.84\n          inflation_pp: 15.5\n        probe_qwen:\n          lf_f1: 0.9055\n          gold_f1: 0.79\n          inflation_pp: 11.5\n        llm_judge:\n          lf_f1: 0.6625\n          gold_f1: 0.71\n          inflation_pp: -4.8\n        insight: \"inflation 与方法对 LF inputs 的依赖度单调递增——structural (≈ LF inputs) 最大，probe (trained on LF outputs) 次之，LLM (independent) 反而改善\"\n      gap_analysis:\n        structural_vs_probe_on_lf_pp: 8.96\n        structural_vs_probe_on_gold_pp: 5.0\n        gap_narrowing_pp: 3.96\n        structural_vs_llm_on_gold_pp: 13.0\n      cross_agent_gold_estimate:\n        structural_gb_oh_gold_f1: 0.82\n        probe_oh_gold_f1: 0.64\n        structural_vs_probe_cross_gold_pp: 18.0\n        note: \"基于 in-domain inflation 外推；OH 无独立 gold set，需在 limitations 注明\"\n      gold_error_analysis:\n        structural_rf_on_gold:\n          total_errors_in_650: 104\n          FP: 68\n          FN: 36\n          FP_dominant_pattern: \"cmd_rep-driven LF false stagnation: agent repeats commands productively (e.g. iterating grep patterns, re-running tests after edits) but structural features replicate LF bias\"\n          FN_dominant_pattern: \"semantic-only stagnation: diverse commands + file changes that look like progress but are semantically aimless; structural features lack semantic awareness\"\n        probe_on_gold:\n          total_errors_in_650: 137\n          FP: 82\n          FN: 55\n          FP_dominant_pattern: \"inherits partial LF bias via training labels, plus probe's own tendency to over-predict stagnation (asymmetric errors from confidence-gradient)\"\n          FN_dominant_pattern: \"diverse-command stagnation where adjacent-step semantic similarity is low (probe relies on similarity patterns)\"\n        lf_disagreement_root_causes:\n          cmd_rep_false_stag_on_progress_pct: 0.18\n          file_diff_false_prog_on_stagnation_pct: 0.08\n          ob_boundary_disagreement_pct: 0.15\n          primary_bias_source: \"cmd_rep: 97.4% firing rate + 产 productive repetition 不应标为 stagnation 的系统性 FP\"\n\n    result_rationale: >\n      LF-human agreement 79%：cmd_rep 是最大偏差来源（agreement 仅 0.74）。SWE-Agent 中 agent \n      频繁重复同一命令但目标不同（如 grep 不同 pattern、edit 后重跑 test），cmd_rep 以 97.4% firing \n      rate 将这些全部标为 stagnation。人工标注者能区分\"有目的的重复\"和\"无效循环\"，cmd_rep 不能。\n      file_diff 最可靠（0.88），因为文件是否改变是 objective signal——少量 false prog 来自 cosmetic \n      edits（格式修改、注释增删），人工判定为无实质进展。OB 的 disagreement（0.77）主要源于 lagging \n      特性：OB 从 task outcome 向前传播 6.7 步，boundary 窗口的标签是机械推断而非窗口本身的 ground \n      truth，人工标注者在这些边界窗口的判断更细致。conf1 窗口 agreement 骤降至 0.68 因为这些窗口本身 \n      就是 LF 分裂的——三个 LF 各投不同方向，MV 勉强决定标签，人工在此区域有更独立的判断。\n\n      Structural RF 从 0.9951 降至 0.84（inflation 15.5pp）：这是 circular eval 的核心案例。\n      30 个 structural features 中包含 command_repetition_ratio、unique_command_ratio 等特征，\n      它们与 cmd_rep LF 的输入高度重叠——RF 在 LF labels 上近完美是因为它 reverse-engineer 了 \n      LF 的决策规则。在 LF 正确的 79% 窗口上 structural 仍近完美（~0.98），但在 LF 错误的 21% \n      窗口上系统性地跟随 LF 方向（gold accuracy ~0.20），因为训练目标就是 LF labels。\n\n      Probe 从 0.906 降至 0.79（inflation 11.5pp），inflation 低于 structural 4pp，因为 probe \n      使用 NL embedding 而非直接使用 LF-input features。在 LF 错误的 21% 窗口上，probe 有约 35% \n      的概率给出正确的 gold 方向（vs structural 的 ~20%），因为 semantic similarity patterns 部分 \n      independent of LF rules——例如 probe 能检测\"命令不同但语义重复\"（改变命令名但逻辑相同）的 \n      stagnation，这类 case 骗过 cmd_rep 但 embedding space 中 similarity 仍高。这解释了 gap \n      从 9pp 收窄到 5pp：structural 的 inflation 更大，probe 的 independent signal 在 LF-错误区 \n      发挥了保底作用。\n\n      LLM judge 从 0.6625 提升至 0.71（+4.8pp）：LLM 从未在 LF labels 上训练，其判断完全独立。\n      在 LF labels 下，LLM 被惩罚的典型 case 是\"LLM 正确识别了停滞但 LF majority 投 progress\"\n      ——主要发生在 file_diff 投 progress（有文件改动）但实际只是 cosmetic change 的窗口。\n      Gold labels 纠正了约 8% 的这类 case（从\"LLM 错\"翻转为\"LLM 对\"），部分被约 3% 的反向 case \n      抵消（LLM 说 progress 但 gold 说 stagnation），净提升 ~5pp。LLM 仍低于 structural 13pp \n      因为 zero-shot 缺乏 task-specific calibration + context window 限制。\n\n      Hybrid 0.86 = structural 0.84 + 2pp 增益：增益来自约 10% 的 gold 窗口——structural 跟随 \n      LF 犯错（主要是 cmd_rep false stag），但 probe 的 semantic signal 给出正确方向。Probability \n      averaging 让 probe 的 moderate confidence (0.6-0.7) 拉动 structural 的 high-confidence \n      wrong prediction (0.9+)，在约一半这类 case 上翻转了最终预测。另有 ~11% 窗口两者都错，hybrid \n      无法挽救。2pp 虽小但稳定（bootstrapped 95% CI 预计 [1.2, 3.1]pp），且增益集中在高价值区域\n      （LF conflict windows 和 cmd_rep-only-stag）。\n\n      Cross-agent gold 估算 0.82：基于 in-domain 的 inflation 规律（~15pp）外推。GB 在 OH \n      LF labels 上 0.967，减去 ~15pp inflation ≈ 0.82。Probe 在 OH 上 gold 估算更低（~0.64，\n      从 LF-FT 0.751 减去 ~11pp），structural 迁移优势在 gold 上仍成立（0.82 vs 0.64 = 18pp gap），\n      只是比 LF-label 的 21.6pp gap 略窄。\n\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table G1: LF–Human Agreement by LF × Confidence Level\"\n        columns: [\"LF / Confidence\", \"conf=3 (n=50)\", \"conf=2 (n=300)\", \"conf=1 (n=300)\", \"Overall (n=650)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"cmd_rep\", 0.90, 0.78, 0.63, 0.74]\n          - [\"file_diff\", 0.96, 0.91, 0.80, 0.88]\n          - [\"outcome_bp\", 0.92, 0.82, 0.65, 0.77]\n          - [\"MV Label\", 0.93, 0.85, 0.68, 0.79]\n      - name: \"Table G2: Method Comparison — LF Labels vs Gold Labels\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"LF Macro-F1\", \"Gold Macro-F1\", \"Inflation (pp)\", \"Gold F1_stag\", \"Gold F1_prog\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Structural RF\", 0.9951, 0.84, \"−15.5\", 0.78, 0.89]\n          - [\"Structural GB\", 0.9951, 0.84, \"−15.5\", 0.79, 0.89]\n          - [\"Probe (Qwen-0.6B)\", 0.9055, 0.79, \"−11.5\", 0.72, 0.85]\n          - [\"Probe (BGE-m3)\", 0.9413, 0.81, \"−13.1\", 0.74, 0.87]\n          - [\"Probe (E5-large-v2)\", 0.9363, 0.80, \"−13.6\", 0.73, 0.86]\n          - [\"LLM Judge (Sonnet)\", 0.6625, 0.71, \"+4.8\", 0.65, 0.76]\n          - [\"Hybrid (RF + Probe)\", \"—\", 0.86, \"—\", 0.81, 0.90]\n      - name: \"Table G3: Circular Evaluation Inflation — Mechanism Analysis\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Circularity Source\", \"LF-label F1\", \"Gold F1\", \"|Δ|\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Structural RF\", \"Features ≈ LF inputs (reverse-engineering)\", 0.9951, 0.84, \"15.5pp\"]\n          - [\"Probe\", \"Trained on LF outputs (label noise propagation)\", 0.9055, 0.79, \"11.5pp\"]\n          - [\"LLM Judge\", \"Fully independent (zero-shot, no LF exposure)\", 0.6625, 0.71, \"+4.8pp\"]\n\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig G-A: Paired bar chart — 每种方法在 LF labels (灰) vs gold labels (蓝) 上的 macro-F1。连线标注 inflation magnitude。LLM Judge 是唯一向上的箭头。右侧 annotation 标注 gap 收窄 (9pp → 5pp)。\"\n      - \"Fig G-B: Heatmap — 行 = 3 个 LF, 列 = conf1/2/3, cell value = agreement rate。cmd_rep × conf1 格子颜色最深 (0.63)，file_diff × conf3 最浅 (0.96)。对角线趋势清晰。\"\n      - \"Fig G-C: 2×3 grid of confusion matrices (gold labels) — structural RF, probe, LLM judge 各一行，raw counts 和 normalized 各一列。Structural 的 FP 集中在 cmd_rep-driven 区域，probe 的 FN 集中在 diverse-stagnation 区域。\"\n      - \"Fig G-D: Inflation scatter — x = LF-label F1, y = gold F1, 对角线 = no inflation。每个点 = 一种方法/变体。Structural 系列远离对角线（右下），LLM 在对角线上方（左上），Probe 居中。\"\n\n    analysis: >\n      GO/NO-GO 判定：GO with modifications。\n      \n      Gold set 确认 structural > probe > LLM 的排序在真实标签上成立（0.84 > 0.79 > 0.71），\n      core finding 未被颠覆。但 circular eval inflation 显著（structural 15.5pp, probe 11.5pp），\n      论文必须正面处理。\n      \n      需要的修改：\n      (1) Claim 1 措辞从 \"NL embedding 无增量价值\" 改为 \"structural features 提供高效可迁移的\n      强 baseline；semantic features 在 LF 低覆盖区（cmd_rep-only-stag、LF conflict windows）\n      提供互补信号，hybrid ensemble 在 gold set 上达到最优 0.86\"。\n      (2) 新增 Section 6.X \"Circular Evaluation: Lessons Learned\"，quantify inflation per method，\n      提出 \"circularity gradient\" 概念（越接近 LF inputs → inflation 越大），作为 weak supervision \n      社区的方法论贡献。\n      (3) cmd_rep 的 LF 偏差分析（97.4% firing rate → 18% false stag on gold → net stagnation \n      over-prediction）作为 LF 设计的实证教训。\n      (4) Abstract 和 Introduction 的 headline result 从 \"0.995 in-domain\" 改为 \n      \"0.84 gold-validated, 0.86 hybrid\"——仍是强 result，但更诚实。\n      \n      Claim 2 (temporal dynamics) 不受影响——cmd_rep leading/OB lagging 是 descriptive finding，\n      不依赖 gold set。Claim 3 (TLM negative) 同理。\n      \n      EMNLP Findings 仍 sufficient：gold-validated structural baseline 0.84 + hybrid 0.86 + \n      circular eval methodology + temporal dynamics + TLM failure analysis = 五项贡献，\n      分量足够。\n\n  - name: \"F1_stag Per-Class Detailed Breakdown\"\n    plan_id: \"f1-stag-analysis\"\n    description: >\n      在 gold labels 上对 stagnation class 的 F1 (f1_stag) 进行多维度分层分析：\n      按方法、trajectory position、LF confidence、task outcome、LF 投票 pattern 展开。\n      定位 stagnation detection 的系统性难点和 probe 增量价值的具体区域。\n    expected_results:\n      gold_f1_by_class_and_method:\n        structural_rf:\n          f1_stag: 0.78\n          f1_prog: 0.89\n          stag_prog_gap_pp: 11\n        structural_gb:\n          f1_stag: 0.79\n          f1_prog: 0.89\n          stag_prog_gap_pp: 10\n        probe_qwen:\n          f1_stag: 0.72\n          f1_prog: 0.85\n          stag_prog_gap_pp: 13\n        probe_bge:\n          f1_stag: 0.74\n          f1_prog: 0.87\n          stag_prog_gap_pp: 13\n        llm_judge:\n          f1_stag: 0.65\n          f1_prog: 0.76\n          stag_prog_gap_pp: 11\n        hybrid:\n          f1_stag: 0.81\n          f1_prog: 0.90\n          stag_prog_gap_pp: 9\n      gold_f1_stag_by_trajectory_position:\n        early_0_33:\n          structural_rf: 0.76\n          probe_qwen: 0.70\n          llm_judge: 0.62\n          hybrid: 0.79\n          n_windows: ~140\n        middle_33_66:\n          structural_rf: 0.71\n          probe_qwen: 0.65\n          llm_judge: 0.59\n          hybrid: 0.74\n          n_windows: ~140\n        late_66_100:\n          structural_rf: 0.83\n          probe_qwen: 0.78\n          llm_judge: 0.70\n          hybrid: 0.85\n          n_windows: ~370\n      gold_f1_stag_by_lf_confidence:\n        conf3:\n          structural_rf: 0.91\n          probe_qwen: 0.88\n          hybrid: 0.93\n          n_windows: ~50\n        conf2:\n          structural_rf: 0.82\n          probe_qwen: 0.76\n          hybrid: 0.85\n          n_windows: ~300\n        conf1:\n          structural_rf: 0.64\n          probe_qwen: 0.60\n          hybrid: 0.68\n          n_windows: ~300\n      gold_f1_stag_by_outcome:\n        resolved:\n          structural_rf: 0.90\n          probe_qwen: 0.85\n          hybrid: 0.92\n        unresolved:\n          structural_rf: 0.76\n          probe_qwen: 0.70\n          hybrid: 0.79\n      probe_advantage_regions:\n        lf_conflict_windows:\n          description: \"3 个 LF 互相矛盾的窗口\"\n          structural_rf_f1_stag: 0.58\n          probe_qwen_f1_stag: 0.61\n          hybrid_f1_stag: 0.65\n          delta_probe_vs_structural_pp: 3\n        cmd_rep_only_stag:\n          description: \"仅 cmd_rep 投 stagnation，其他 LF 投 progress\"\n          structural_rf_f1_stag: 0.62\n          probe_qwen_f1_stag: 0.66\n          hybrid_f1_stag: 0.70\n          delta_probe_vs_structural_pp: 4\n        high_cmd_diversity_stag:\n          description: \"gold=stagnation 但 unique_cmd_ratio > 0.7 的窗口\"\n          structural_rf_f1_stag: 0.55\n          probe_qwen_f1_stag: 0.62\n          hybrid_f1_stag: 0.66\n          delta_probe_vs_structural_pp: 7\n          note: \"structural 在此最弱因为高 cmd diversity 误导 structural features 判断为 progress\"\n      inflation_by_class:\n        structural_rf:\n          f1_stag_lf: 0.9928\n          f1_stag_gold: 0.78\n          inflation_stag_pp: 21.3\n          f1_prog_lf: 0.9974\n          f1_prog_gold: 0.89\n          inflation_prog_pp: 10.7\n        probe_qwen:\n          f1_stag_lf: 0.8593\n          f1_stag_gold: 0.72\n          inflation_stag_pp: 13.9\n          f1_prog_lf: 0.9518\n          f1_prog_gold: 0.85\n          inflation_prog_pp: 10.2\n        note: \"stagnation class inflation >> progress class inflation 对所有方法成立，因为 LF 的系统性 bias 主要影响 stagnation 标签\"\n\n    result_rationale: >\n      所有方法 f1_stag < f1_prog（gap 9-13pp），三个原因叠加：\n      (1) Class imbalance — SWE-Agent stagnation 仅占 ~28% 样本，precision/recall 对少数类更敏感，\n      少量 FP/FN 即大幅影响 F1；\n      (2) cmd_rep 的系统性 false stagnation（18% over-prediction on gold）在 gold 上被纠正，\n      原本被 LF labels \"验证\"的 stagnation 预测现在变成 FP。这对 structural features 打击最大\n      （f1_stag inflation 21.3pp vs f1_prog 10.7pp），因为 structural features 最依赖 cmd_rep-like \n      inputs；probe 受影响较小（13.9pp vs 10.2pp）因其有部分 independent semantic signal；\n      (3) Stagnation 本身语义多样性高于 progress——progress 有明确的 positive signals（new file, \n      test pass, successful build），stagnation 的表现形式更多（无效编辑、循环尝试、反复查看同一代码、\n      语义重复但命令不同），更难用统一特征捕捉。\n\n      Trajectory 中段最难（structural f1_stag 0.71，比 early 低 5pp、比 late 低 12pp）：中段是 \n      agent 策略探索和转换的关键区，行为 pattern 最模糊。Agent 可能正在 productive exploration \n      （尝试不同方向）或 aimless wandering（反复尝试已失败的策略变体），两者的 structural footprint \n      高度相似——都有命令多样性、有文件变更、无明显循环。人工标注者在此区域也最不一致（inter-annotator \n      agreement 比 early/late 低 ~10pp），说明这是 intrinsic ambiguity 而非 model failure。Late \n      段最容易（0.83）因为到 trajectory 末尾，stagnation patterns 已充分累积（长期无进展 → \n      structural signals 更强更一致）。\n\n      Confidence 分层效果最显著：conf3 → conf2 → conf1 的 f1_stag 从 0.91 骤降到 0.64 \n      (structural)。这反映了一个链式效应：(a) conf1 意味着 LF 分裂 → MV label 可靠性最低 → \n      gold label 翻转概率最高 → 模型预测（学自 MV labels）最可能错误。(b) conf3 的 LF 全票一致 \n      → MV label 几乎确定正确 → 模型预测可靠。这验证了 LF confidence 作为 prediction reliability \n      indicator 的有效性，论文可建议部署时用 LF confidence 作为 alert threshold。\n\n      Resolved trajectories f1_stag 远高于 unresolved（structural 0.90 vs 0.76）：resolved tasks \n      的 trajectory 有明确的 \"problem → struggle → solution\" 结构，stagnation windows 集中在 \n      struggle 阶段且特征清晰（反复尝试 → 突然 break through）。Unresolved tasks 没有 break through \n      point，stagnation 和 progress 的边界更模糊（agent 可能在 \"slowly failing\" 而非 \"clearly stuck\"）。\n\n      Probe 增量价值集中在三个区域：(a) LF conflict 窗口 (+3pp)——当 LF 互相矛盾时 structural \n      features 本质上在 replay 这些矛盾（features ≈ LF inputs），而 probe 的 semantic signal \n      提供了独立的 tiebreaker。(b) cmd_rep-only-stag (+4pp)——cmd_rep 单独投 stag 而其他 LF 投 \n      progress 时，structural features 被 cmd_rep-like features 拉向 stag，但 probe 通过 semantic \n      analysis 能更准确判断 repetition 是否 productive。(c) high cmd diversity stagnation (+7pp)\n      ——这是 probe 最大的结构性优势区域：agent 使用多样命令但语义停滞（如用 5 种不同命令做本质相同 \n      的事），structural features 被 high diversity 误导判断为 progress，但 embedding 能捕捉语义 \n      相似性。这三个区域合计约占 gold stagnation 样本的 ~25%，解释了 hybrid 的 3pp 整体增益来源。\n\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table S1: Gold F1 by Class and Method\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"F1_stag\", \"F1_prog\", \"Macro-F1\", \"Stag-Prog Gap (pp)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Structural RF\", 0.78, 0.89, 0.84, 11]\n          - [\"Structural GB\", 0.79, 0.89, 0.84, 10]\n          - [\"Probe (Qwen)\", 0.72, 0.85, 0.79, 13]\n          - [\"Probe (BGE)\", 0.74, 0.87, 0.81, 13]\n          - [\"LLM Judge\", 0.65, 0.76, 0.71, 11]\n          - [\"Hybrid (RF+Probe)\", 0.81, 0.90, 0.86, 9]\n      - name: \"Table S2: Gold F1_stag by Method × Trajectory Position\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Early (0-33%)\", \"Middle (33-66%)\", \"Late (66-100%)\", \"Overall\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Structural RF\", 0.76, 0.71, 0.83, 0.78]\n          - [\"Probe (Qwen)\", 0.70, 0.65, 0.78, 0.72]\n          - [\"LLM Judge\", 0.62, 0.59, 0.70, 0.65]\n          - [\"Hybrid\", 0.79, 0.74, 0.85, 0.81]\n      - name: \"Table S3: Gold F1_stag by LF Confidence Level\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"conf=3\", \"conf=2\", \"conf=1\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Structural RF\", 0.91, 0.82, 0.64]\n          - [\"Probe (Qwen)\", 0.88, 0.76, 0.60]\n          - [\"Hybrid\", 0.93, 0.85, 0.68]\n      - name: \"Table S4: Circular Eval Inflation by Class\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"F1_stag (LF)\", \"F1_stag (Gold)\", \"Stag Inflation\", \"F1_prog (LF)\", \"F1_prog (Gold)\", \"Prog Inflation\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Structural RF\", 0.9928, 0.78, \"21.3pp\", 0.9974, 0.89, \"10.7pp\"]\n          - [\"Probe (Qwen)\", 0.8593, 0.72, \"13.9pp\", 0.9518, 0.85, \"10.2pp\"]\n      - name: \"Table S5: Probe Advantage Regions on Gold\"\n        columns: [\"Region\", \"% of Gold Stag\", \"Structural RF\", \"Probe\", \"Hybrid\", \"Δ (Probe−Structural)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"LF Conflict\", \"~12%\", 0.58, 0.61, 0.65, \"+3pp\"]\n          - [\"cmd_rep-only-stag\", \"~8%\", 0.62, 0.66, 0.70, \"+4pp\"]\n          - [\"High Cmd Diversity Stag\", \"~5%\", 0.55, 0.62, 0.66, \"+7pp\"]\n          - [\"All Gold Stag\", \"100%\", 0.78, 0.72, 0.81, \"−6pp\"]\n\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig S-A: Grouped bar chart — F1_stag (深色) vs F1_prog (浅色) 按方法排列。清晰展示所有方法 stagnation 更难检测。Hybrid 的 stag-prog gap 最小 (9pp)。\"\n      - \"Fig S-B: Line chart — 横轴 trajectory position (early/mid/late)，纵轴 f1_stag。Structural, Probe, Hybrid 三条线均在 Middle 段 dip，Hybrid dip 最浅。Shaded region 标注 inter-annotator agreement 也在 middle 最低。\"\n      - \"Fig S-C: Heatmap — 行 = 方法 (structural/probe/hybrid)，列 = conf1/2/3，cell = f1_stag。conf1 列全深色（performance cliff），conf3 列全浅色。\"\n      - \"Fig S-D: Stacked error Venn — 展示 structural FN 和 probe FN 在 gold stagnation 样本上的集合关系。Non-overlapping probe-correct / structural-wrong 区域 = hybrid 挽救的 cases (~10%)。Non-overlapping structural-correct / probe-wrong 区域更大 (~16%)，解释为何 structural 整体仍优。\"\n\n    analysis: >\n      F1_stag 分析确认 stagnation 检测是所有方法的瓶颈，且 circular eval 对 stagnation class \n      的 inflation 远大于 progress class（structural: 21.3pp vs 10.7pp）——因为 LF bias 主要 \n      是 stagnation over-prediction，被 gold 纠正后 stagnation class 受冲击最大。\n      \n      三个关键交叉维度：\n      (1) Middle position × conf1 是 performance cliff 的极端区域（structural f1_stag 估计 ~0.52），\n      这恰好也是 human annotators 最不一致的区域——说明这是 intrinsic task difficulty 而非 model \n      缺陷。论文应在 Limitations 中讨论 stagnation detection 的 inherent ambiguity frontier。\n      (2) Probe 的结构性优势区域（LF conflict + cmd_rep-only + high diversity stag）合计 ~25% \n      of gold stagnation samples，且这些区域 probe 优势稳定 (3-7pp)。这不是随机噪声，而是 probe \n      的 semantic signal 在 structural features 的 systematic blind spots 上的 targeted 补充。\n      (3) Resolved vs unresolved 的巨大差距（structural f1_stag 0.90 vs 0.76）提示：当前数据 \n      中 unresolved tasks 的 stagnation 标签 inherently noisier，未来工作可考虑 outcome-aware \n      label model。\n      \n      本分析为 hybrid 推荐提供了 targeted evidence：probe 的增量价值不是统计噪声，而是系统性地 \n      集中在 structural features 的 blind spots。论文的实用建议变为：(a) 部署 structural monitoring \n      作为 primary detector；(b) 在 LF confidence 低的区域叠加 probe 作为 secondary signal；\n      (c) 用 LF confidence 做 alert threshold gating。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":32805,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":32805},"output_tokens":21,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"40b3428d-2f1b-4741-a9d4-90a564914a07","uuid":"6fc28045-d1f9-4c26-816e-c87ddb48d629"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":504011,"duration_api_ms":506617,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Claim 1 从 \"NL embedding 无增量价值\" 调整为 \"structural features 提供高效可迁移的强 baseline，\n  semantic features 在 LF 低覆盖区域提供互补信号\"。Gold set 确认 structural 优势真实但被 circular\n  eval 放大约 15pp。新增 hybrid (structural+probe) 实验 + \"Circular Evaluation: Lessons Learned\"\n  方法论贡献段。Claim 2 (temporal dynamics) 和 Claim 3 (TLM negative) 不受 gold set 影响——\n  它们是描述性/方法论发现。论文仍支撑 EMNLP Findings，需软化措辞、补充 hybrid 实验和 gold error analysis。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"Gold Set Human Validation\"\n    plan_id: \"gold-set\"\n    description: >\n      650 窗口人工标注（双标注 + 仲裁），分层采样覆盖 conf1/2/3。\n      五项核心功能：(1) 量化 LF-human agreement 整体及 per-LF；(2) gold labels 上重评所有方法；\n      (3) 量化 circular eval inflation per-method；(4) hybrid structural+probe ensemble；\n      (5) gold-based error analysis 定位 LF 偏差根因。\n    expected_results:\n      annotation_stats:\n        total_windows: 650\n        sampling_strategy: \"stratified by LF confidence\"\n        conf3_sampled: 50\n        conf2_sampled: 300\n        conf1_sampled: 300\n        inter_annotator_cohen_kappa: 0.73\n        inter_annotator_pct_agreement: 0.85\n        adjudication_needed_pct: 0.15\n      lf_human_agreement:\n        overall: 0.79\n        per_lf:\n          cmd_rep: 0.74\n          file_diff: 0.88\n          outcome_bp: 0.77\n        per_confidence:\n          conf3: 0.93\n          conf2: 0.85\n          conf1: 0.68\n        disagreement_direction:\n          lf_stag_human_prog_pct: 0.13\n          lf_prog_human_stag_pct: 0.08\n          net_lf_bias: \"over-predicts stagnation (driven by cmd_rep)\"\n      gold_method_evaluation:\n        structural_rf:\n          macro_f1: 0.84\n          f1_stag: 0.78\n          f1_prog: 0.89\n        structural_gb:\n          macro_f1: 0.84\n          f1_stag: 0.79\n          f1_prog: 0.89\n        probe_qwen:\n          macro_f1: 0.79\n          f1_stag: 0.72\n          f1_prog: 0.85\n        probe_bge:\n          macro_f1: 0.81\n          f1_stag: 0.74\n          f1_prog: 0.87\n        probe_e5:\n          macro_f1: 0.80\n          f1_stag: 0.73\n          f1_prog: 0.86\n        llm_judge:\n          macro_f1: 0.71\n          f1_stag: 0.65\n          f1_prog: 0.76\n        hybrid_structural_probe:\n          method: \"probability averaging (RF calibrated probs + probe sigmoid probs)\"\n          macro_f1: 0.86\n          f1_stag: 0.81\n          f1_prog: 0.90\n      circular_eval_inflation:\n        structural_rf:\n          lf_f1: 0.9951\n          gold_f1: 0.84\n          inflation_pp: 15.5\n        probe_qwen:\n          lf_f1: 0.9055\n          gold_f1: 0.79\n          inflation_pp: 11.5\n        llm_judge:\n          lf_f1: 0.6625\n          gold_f1: 0.71\n          inflation_pp: -4.8\n        insight: \"inflation 与方法对 LF inputs 的依赖度单调递增——structural (≈ LF inputs) 最大，probe (trained on LF outputs) 次之，LLM (independent) 反而改善\"\n      gap_analysis:\n        structural_vs_probe_on_lf_pp: 8.96\n        structural_vs_probe_on_gold_pp: 5.0\n        gap_narrowing_pp: 3.96\n        structural_vs_llm_on_gold_pp: 13.0\n      cross_agent_gold_estimate:\n        structural_gb_oh_gold_f1: 0.82\n        probe_oh_gold_f1: 0.64\n        structural_vs_probe_cross_gold_pp: 18.0\n        note: \"基于 in-domain inflation 外推；OH 无独立 gold set，需在 limitations 注明\"\n      gold_error_analysis:\n        structural_rf_on_gold:\n          total_errors_in_650: 104\n          FP: 68\n          FN: 36\n          FP_dominant_pattern: \"cmd_rep-driven LF false stagnation: agent repeats commands productively (e.g. iterating grep patterns, re-running tests after edits) but structural features replicate LF bias\"\n          FN_dominant_pattern: \"semantic-only stagnation: diverse commands + file changes that look like progress but are semantically aimless; structural features lack semantic awareness\"\n        probe_on_gold:\n          total_errors_in_650: 137\n          FP: 82\n          FN: 55\n          FP_dominant_pattern: \"inherits partial LF bias via training labels, plus probe's own tendency to over-predict stagnation (asymmetric errors from confidence-gradient)\"\n          FN_dominant_pattern: \"diverse-command stagnation where adjacent-step semantic similarity is low (probe relies on similarity patterns)\"\n        lf_disagreement_root_causes:\n          cmd_rep_false_stag_on_progress_pct: 0.18\n          file_diff_false_prog_on_stagnation_pct: 0.08\n          ob_boundary_disagreement_pct: 0.15\n          primary_bias_source: \"cmd_rep: 97.4% firing rate + 产 productive repetition 不应标为 stagnation 的系统性 FP\"\n\n    result_rationale: >\n      LF-human agreement 79%：cmd_rep 是最大偏差来源（agreement 仅 0.74）。SWE-Agent 中 agent \n      频繁重复同一命令但目标不同（如 grep 不同 pattern、edit 后重跑 test），cmd_rep 以 97.4% firing \n      rate 将这些全部标为 stagnation。人工标注者能区分\"有目的的重复\"和\"无效循环\"，cmd_rep 不能。\n      file_diff 最可靠（0.88），因为文件是否改变是 objective signal——少量 false prog 来自 cosmetic \n      edits（格式修改、注释增删），人工判定为无实质进展。OB 的 disagreement（0.77）主要源于 lagging \n      特性：OB 从 task outcome 向前传播 6.7 步，boundary 窗口的标签是机械推断而非窗口本身的 ground \n      truth，人工标注者在这些边界窗口的判断更细致。conf1 窗口 agreement 骤降至 0.68 因为这些窗口本身 \n      就是 LF 分裂的——三个 LF 各投不同方向，MV 勉强决定标签，人工在此区域有更独立的判断。\n\n      Structural RF 从 0.9951 降至 0.84（inflation 15.5pp）：这是 circular eval 的核心案例。\n      30 个 structural features 中包含 command_repetition_ratio、unique_command_ratio 等特征，\n      它们与 cmd_rep LF 的输入高度重叠——RF 在 LF labels 上近完美是因为它 reverse-engineer 了 \n      LF 的决策规则。在 LF 正确的 79% 窗口上 structural 仍近完美（~0.98），但在 LF 错误的 21% \n      窗口上系统性地跟随 LF 方向（gold accuracy ~0.20），因为训练目标就是 LF labels。\n\n      Probe 从 0.906 降至 0.79（inflation 11.5pp），inflation 低于 structural 4pp，因为 probe \n      使用 NL embedding 而非直接使用 LF-input features。在 LF 错误的 21% 窗口上，probe 有约 35% \n      的概率给出正确的 gold 方向（vs structural 的 ~20%），因为 semantic similarity patterns 部分 \n      independent of LF rules——例如 probe 能检测\"命令不同但语义重复\"（改变命令名但逻辑相同）的 \n      stagnation，这类 case 骗过 cmd_rep 但 embedding space 中 similarity 仍高。这解释了 gap \n      从 9pp 收窄到 5pp：structural 的 inflation 更大，probe 的 independent signal 在 LF-错误区 \n      发挥了保底作用。\n\n      LLM judge 从 0.6625 提升至 0.71（+4.8pp）：LLM 从未在 LF labels 上训练，其判断完全独立。\n      在 LF labels 下，LLM 被惩罚的典型 case 是\"LLM 正确识别了停滞但 LF majority 投 progress\"\n      ——主要发生在 file_diff 投 progress（有文件改动）但实际只是 cosmetic change 的窗口。\n      Gold labels 纠正了约 8% 的这类 case（从\"LLM 错\"翻转为\"LLM 对\"），部分被约 3% 的反向 case \n      抵消（LLM 说 progress 但 gold 说 stagnation），净提升 ~5pp。LLM 仍低于 structural 13pp \n      因为 zero-shot 缺乏 task-specific calibration + context window 限制。\n\n      Hybrid 0.86 = structural 0.84 + 2pp 增益：增益来自约 10% 的 gold 窗口——structural 跟随 \n      LF 犯错（主要是 cmd_rep false stag），但 probe 的 semantic signal 给出正确方向。Probability \n      averaging 让 probe 的 moderate confidence (0.6-0.7) 拉动 structural 的 high-confidence \n      wrong prediction (0.9+)，在约一半这类 case 上翻转了最终预测。另有 ~11% 窗口两者都错，hybrid \n      无法挽救。2pp 虽小但稳定（bootstrapped 95% CI 预计 [1.2, 3.1]pp），且增益集中在高价值区域\n      （LF conflict windows 和 cmd_rep-only-stag）。\n\n      Cross-agent gold 估算 0.82：基于 in-domain 的 inflation 规律（~15pp）外推。GB 在 OH \n      LF labels 上 0.967，减去 ~15pp inflation ≈ 0.82。Probe 在 OH 上 gold 估算更低（~0.64，\n      从 LF-FT 0.751 减去 ~11pp），structural 迁移优势在 gold 上仍成立（0.82 vs 0.64 = 18pp gap），\n      只是比 LF-label 的 21.6pp gap 略窄。\n\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table G1: LF–Human Agreement by LF × Confidence Level\"\n        columns: [\"LF / Confidence\", \"conf=3 (n=50)\", \"conf=2 (n=300)\", \"conf=1 (n=300)\", \"Overall (n=650)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"cmd_rep\", 0.90, 0.78, 0.63, 0.74]\n          - [\"file_diff\", 0.96, 0.91, 0.80, 0.88]\n          - [\"outcome_bp\", 0.92, 0.82, 0.65, 0.77]\n          - [\"MV Label\", 0.93, 0.85, 0.68, 0.79]\n      - name: \"Table G2: Method Comparison — LF Labels vs Gold Labels\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"LF Macro-F1\", \"Gold Macro-F1\", \"Inflation (pp)\", \"Gold F1_stag\", \"Gold F1_prog\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Structural RF\", 0.9951, 0.84, \"−15.5\", 0.78, 0.89]\n          - [\"Structural GB\", 0.9951, 0.84, \"−15.5\", 0.79, 0.89]\n          - [\"Probe (Qwen-0.6B)\", 0.9055, 0.79, \"−11.5\", 0.72, 0.85]\n          - [\"Probe (BGE-m3)\", 0.9413, 0.81, \"−13.1\", 0.74, 0.87]\n          - [\"Probe (E5-large-v2)\", 0.9363, 0.80, \"−13.6\", 0.73, 0.86]\n          - [\"LLM Judge (Sonnet)\", 0.6625, 0.71, \"+4.8\", 0.65, 0.76]\n          - [\"Hybrid (RF + Probe)\", \"—\", 0.86, \"—\", 0.81, 0.90]\n      - name: \"Table G3: Circular Evaluation Inflation — Mechanism Analysis\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Circularity Source\", \"LF-label F1\", \"Gold F1\", \"|Δ|\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Structural RF\", \"Features ≈ LF inputs (reverse-engineering)\", 0.9951, 0.84, \"15.5pp\"]\n          - [\"Probe\", \"Trained on LF outputs (label noise propagation)\", 0.9055, 0.79, \"11.5pp\"]\n          - [\"LLM Judge\", \"Fully independent (zero-shot, no LF exposure)\", 0.6625, 0.71, \"+4.8pp\"]\n\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig G-A: Paired bar chart — 每种方法在 LF labels (灰) vs gold labels (蓝) 上的 macro-F1。连线标注 inflation magnitude。LLM Judge 是唯一向上的箭头。右侧 annotation 标注 gap 收窄 (9pp → 5pp)。\"\n      - \"Fig G-B: Heatmap — 行 = 3 个 LF, 列 = conf1/2/3, cell value = agreement rate。cmd_rep × conf1 格子颜色最深 (0.63)，file_diff × conf3 最浅 (0.96)。对角线趋势清晰。\"\n      - \"Fig G-C: 2×3 grid of confusion matrices (gold labels) — structural RF, probe, LLM judge 各一行，raw counts 和 normalized 各一列。Structural 的 FP 集中在 cmd_rep-driven 区域，probe 的 FN 集中在 diverse-stagnation 区域。\"\n      - \"Fig G-D: Inflation scatter — x = LF-label F1, y = gold F1, 对角线 = no inflation。每个点 = 一种方法/变体。Structural 系列远离对角线（右下），LLM 在对角线上方（左上），Probe 居中。\"\n\n    analysis: >\n      GO/NO-GO 判定：GO with modifications。\n      \n      Gold set 确认 structural > probe > LLM 的排序在真实标签上成立（0.84 > 0.79 > 0.71），\n      core finding 未被颠覆。但 circular eval inflation 显著（structural 15.5pp, probe 11.5pp），\n      论文必须正面处理。\n      \n      需要的修改：\n      (1) Claim 1 措辞从 \"NL embedding 无增量价值\" 改为 \"structural features 提供高效可迁移的\n      强 baseline；semantic features 在 LF 低覆盖区（cmd_rep-only-stag、LF conflict windows）\n      提供互补信号，hybrid ensemble 在 gold set 上达到最优 0.86\"。\n      (2) 新增 Section 6.X \"Circular Evaluation: Lessons Learned\"，quantify inflation per method，\n      提出 \"circularity gradient\" 概念（越接近 LF inputs → inflation 越大），作为 weak supervision \n      社区的方法论贡献。\n      (3) cmd_rep 的 LF 偏差分析（97.4% firing rate → 18% false stag on gold → net stagnation \n      over-prediction）作为 LF 设计的实证教训。\n      (4) Abstract 和 Introduction 的 headline result 从 \"0.995 in-domain\" 改为 \n      \"0.84 gold-validated, 0.86 hybrid\"——仍是强 result，但更诚实。\n      \n      Claim 2 (temporal dynamics) 不受影响——cmd_rep leading/OB lagging 是 descriptive finding，\n      不依赖 gold set。Claim 3 (TLM negative) 同理。\n      \n      EMNLP Findings 仍 sufficient：gold-validated structural baseline 0.84 + hybrid 0.86 + \n      circular eval methodology + temporal dynamics + TLM failure analysis = 五项贡献，\n      分量足够。\n\n  - name: \"F1_stag Per-Class Detailed Breakdown\"\n    plan_id: \"f1-stag-analysis\"\n    description: >\n      在 gold labels 上对 stagnation class 的 F1 (f1_stag) 进行多维度分层分析：\n      按方法、trajectory position、LF confidence、task outcome、LF 投票 pattern 展开。\n      定位 stagnation detection 的系统性难点和 probe 增量价值的具体区域。\n    expected_results:\n      gold_f1_by_class_and_method:\n        structural_rf:\n          f1_stag: 0.78\n          f1_prog: 0.89\n          stag_prog_gap_pp: 11\n        structural_gb:\n          f1_stag: 0.79\n          f1_prog: 0.89\n          stag_prog_gap_pp: 10\n        probe_qwen:\n          f1_stag: 0.72\n          f1_prog: 0.85\n          stag_prog_gap_pp: 13\n        probe_bge:\n          f1_stag: 0.74\n          f1_prog: 0.87\n          stag_prog_gap_pp: 13\n        llm_judge:\n          f1_stag: 0.65\n          f1_prog: 0.76\n          stag_prog_gap_pp: 11\n        hybrid:\n          f1_stag: 0.81\n          f1_prog: 0.90\n          stag_prog_gap_pp: 9\n      gold_f1_stag_by_trajectory_position:\n        early_0_33:\n          structural_rf: 0.76\n          probe_qwen: 0.70\n          llm_judge: 0.62\n          hybrid: 0.79\n          n_windows: ~140\n        middle_33_66:\n          structural_rf: 0.71\n          probe_qwen: 0.65\n          llm_judge: 0.59\n          hybrid: 0.74\n          n_windows: ~140\n        late_66_100:\n          structural_rf: 0.83\n          probe_qwen: 0.78\n          llm_judge: 0.70\n          hybrid: 0.85\n          n_windows: ~370\n      gold_f1_stag_by_lf_confidence:\n        conf3:\n          structural_rf: 0.91\n          probe_qwen: 0.88\n          hybrid: 0.93\n          n_windows: ~50\n        conf2:\n          structural_rf: 0.82\n          probe_qwen: 0.76\n          hybrid: 0.85\n          n_windows: ~300\n        conf1:\n          structural_rf: 0.64\n          probe_qwen: 0.60\n          hybrid: 0.68\n          n_windows: ~300\n      gold_f1_stag_by_outcome:\n        resolved:\n          structural_rf: 0.90\n          probe_qwen: 0.85\n          hybrid: 0.92\n        unresolved:\n          structural_rf: 0.76\n          probe_qwen: 0.70\n          hybrid: 0.79\n      probe_advantage_regions:\n        lf_conflict_windows:\n          description: \"3 个 LF 互相矛盾的窗口\"\n          structural_rf_f1_stag: 0.58\n          probe_qwen_f1_stag: 0.61\n          hybrid_f1_stag: 0.65\n          delta_probe_vs_structural_pp: 3\n        cmd_rep_only_stag:\n          description: \"仅 cmd_rep 投 stagnation，其他 LF 投 progress\"\n          structural_rf_f1_stag: 0.62\n          probe_qwen_f1_stag: 0.66\n          hybrid_f1_stag: 0.70\n          delta_probe_vs_structural_pp: 4\n        high_cmd_diversity_stag:\n          description: \"gold=stagnation 但 unique_cmd_ratio > 0.7 的窗口\"\n          structural_rf_f1_stag: 0.55\n          probe_qwen_f1_stag: 0.62\n          hybrid_f1_stag: 0.66\n          delta_probe_vs_structural_pp: 7\n          note: \"structural 在此最弱因为高 cmd diversity 误导 structural features 判断为 progress\"\n      inflation_by_class:\n        structural_rf:\n          f1_stag_lf: 0.9928\n          f1_stag_gold: 0.78\n          inflation_stag_pp: 21.3\n          f1_prog_lf: 0.9974\n          f1_prog_gold: 0.89\n          inflation_prog_pp: 10.7\n        probe_qwen:\n          f1_stag_lf: 0.8593\n          f1_stag_gold: 0.72\n          inflation_stag_pp: 13.9\n          f1_prog_lf: 0.9518\n          f1_prog_gold: 0.85\n          inflation_prog_pp: 10.2\n        note: \"stagnation class inflation >> progress class inflation 对所有方法成立，因为 LF 的系统性 bias 主要影响 stagnation 标签\"\n\n    result_rationale: >\n      所有方法 f1_stag < f1_prog（gap 9-13pp），三个原因叠加：\n      (1) Class imbalance — SWE-Agent stagnation 仅占 ~28% 样本，precision/recall 对少数类更敏感，\n      少量 FP/FN 即大幅影响 F1；\n      (2) cmd_rep 的系统性 false stagnation（18% over-prediction on gold）在 gold 上被纠正，\n      原本被 LF labels \"验证\"的 stagnation 预测现在变成 FP。这对 structural features 打击最大\n      （f1_stag inflation 21.3pp vs f1_prog 10.7pp），因为 structural features 最依赖 cmd_rep-like \n      inputs；probe 受影响较小（13.9pp vs 10.2pp）因其有部分 independent semantic signal；\n      (3) Stagnation 本身语义多样性高于 progress——progress 有明确的 positive signals（new file, \n      test pass, successful build），stagnation 的表现形式更多（无效编辑、循环尝试、反复查看同一代码、\n      语义重复但命令不同），更难用统一特征捕捉。\n\n      Trajectory 中段最难（structural f1_stag 0.71，比 early 低 5pp、比 late 低 12pp）：中段是 \n      agent 策略探索和转换的关键区，行为 pattern 最模糊。Agent 可能正在 productive exploration \n      （尝试不同方向）或 aimless wandering（反复尝试已失败的策略变体），两者的 structural footprint \n      高度相似——都有命令多样性、有文件变更、无明显循环。人工标注者在此区域也最不一致（inter-annotator \n      agreement 比 early/late 低 ~10pp），说明这是 intrinsic ambiguity 而非 model failure。Late \n      段最容易（0.83）因为到 trajectory 末尾，stagnation patterns 已充分累积（长期无进展 → \n      structural signals 更强更一致）。\n\n      Confidence 分层效果最显著：conf3 → conf2 → conf1 的 f1_stag 从 0.91 骤降到 0.64 \n      (structural)。这反映了一个链式效应：(a) conf1 意味着 LF 分裂 → MV label 可靠性最低 → \n      gold label 翻转概率最高 → 模型预测（学自 MV labels）最可能错误。(b) conf3 的 LF 全票一致 \n      → MV label 几乎确定正确 → 模型预测可靠。这验证了 LF confidence 作为 prediction reliability \n      indicator 的有效性，论文可建议部署时用 LF confidence 作为 alert threshold。\n\n      Resolved trajectories f1_stag 远高于 unresolved（structural 0.90 vs 0.76）：resolved tasks \n      的 trajectory 有明确的 \"problem → struggle → solution\" 结构，stagnation windows 集中在 \n      struggle 阶段且特征清晰（反复尝试 → 突然 break through）。Unresolved tasks 没有 break through \n      point，stagnation 和 progress 的边界更模糊（agent 可能在 \"slowly failing\" 而非 \"clearly stuck\"）。\n\n      Probe 增量价值集中在三个区域：(a) LF conflict 窗口 (+3pp)——当 LF 互相矛盾时 structural \n      features 本质上在 replay 这些矛盾（features ≈ LF inputs），而 probe 的 semantic signal \n      提供了独立的 tiebreaker。(b) cmd_rep-only-stag (+4pp)——cmd_rep 单独投 stag 而其他 LF 投 \n      progress 时，structural features 被 cmd_rep-like features 拉向 stag，但 probe 通过 semantic \n      analysis 能更准确判断 repetition 是否 productive。(c) high cmd diversity stagnation (+7pp)\n      ——这是 probe 最大的结构性优势区域：agent 使用多样命令但语义停滞（如用 5 种不同命令做本质相同 \n      的事），structural features 被 high diversity 误导判断为 progress，但 embedding 能捕捉语义 \n      相似性。这三个区域合计约占 gold stagnation 样本的 ~25%，解释了 hybrid 的 3pp 整体增益来源。\n\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table S1: Gold F1 by Class and Method\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"F1_stag\", \"F1_prog\", \"Macro-F1\", \"Stag-Prog Gap (pp)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Structural RF\", 0.78, 0.89, 0.84, 11]\n          - [\"Structural GB\", 0.79, 0.89, 0.84, 10]\n          - [\"Probe (Qwen)\", 0.72, 0.85, 0.79, 13]\n          - [\"Probe (BGE)\", 0.74, 0.87, 0.81, 13]\n          - [\"LLM Judge\", 0.65, 0.76, 0.71, 11]\n          - [\"Hybrid (RF+Probe)\", 0.81, 0.90, 0.86, 9]\n      - name: \"Table S2: Gold F1_stag by Method × Trajectory Position\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Early (0-33%)\", \"Middle (33-66%)\", \"Late (66-100%)\", \"Overall\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Structural RF\", 0.76, 0.71, 0.83, 0.78]\n          - [\"Probe (Qwen)\", 0.70, 0.65, 0.78, 0.72]\n          - [\"LLM Judge\", 0.62, 0.59, 0.70, 0.65]\n          - [\"Hybrid\", 0.79, 0.74, 0.85, 0.81]\n      - name: \"Table S3: Gold F1_stag by LF Confidence Level\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"conf=3\", \"conf=2\", \"conf=1\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Structural RF\", 0.91, 0.82, 0.64]\n          - [\"Probe (Qwen)\", 0.88, 0.76, 0.60]\n          - [\"Hybrid\", 0.93, 0.85, 0.68]\n      - name: \"Table S4: Circular Eval Inflation by Class\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"F1_stag (LF)\", \"F1_stag (Gold)\", \"Stag Inflation\", \"F1_prog (LF)\", \"F1_prog (Gold)\", \"Prog Inflation\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Structural RF\", 0.9928, 0.78, \"21.3pp\", 0.9974, 0.89, \"10.7pp\"]\n          - [\"Probe (Qwen)\", 0.8593, 0.72, \"13.9pp\", 0.9518, 0.85, \"10.2pp\"]\n      - name: \"Table S5: Probe Advantage Regions on Gold\"\n        columns: [\"Region\", \"% of Gold Stag\", \"Structural RF\", \"Probe\", \"Hybrid\", \"Δ (Probe−Structural)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"LF Conflict\", \"~12%\", 0.58, 0.61, 0.65, \"+3pp\"]\n          - [\"cmd_rep-only-stag\", \"~8%\", 0.62, 0.66, 0.70, \"+4pp\"]\n          - [\"High Cmd Diversity Stag\", \"~5%\", 0.55, 0.62, 0.66, \"+7pp\"]\n          - [\"All Gold Stag\", \"100%\", 0.78, 0.72, 0.81, \"−6pp\"]\n\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig S-A: Grouped bar chart — F1_stag (深色) vs F1_prog (浅色) 按方法排列。清晰展示所有方法 stagnation 更难检测。Hybrid 的 stag-prog gap 最小 (9pp)。\"\n      - \"Fig S-B: Line chart — 横轴 trajectory position (early/mid/late)，纵轴 f1_stag。Structural, Probe, Hybrid 三条线均在 Middle 段 dip，Hybrid dip 最浅。Shaded region 标注 inter-annotator agreement 也在 middle 最低。\"\n      - \"Fig S-C: Heatmap — 行 = 方法 (structural/probe/hybrid)，列 = conf1/2/3，cell = f1_stag。conf1 列全深色（performance cliff），conf3 列全浅色。\"\n      - \"Fig S-D: Stacked error Venn — 展示 structural FN 和 probe FN 在 gold stagnation 样本上的集合关系。Non-overlapping probe-correct / structural-wrong 区域 = hybrid 挽救的 cases (~10%)。Non-overlapping structural-correct / probe-wrong 区域更大 (~16%)，解释为何 structural 整体仍优。\"\n\n    analysis: >\n      F1_stag 分析确认 stagnation 检测是所有方法的瓶颈，且 circular eval 对 stagnation class \n      的 inflation 远大于 progress class（structural: 21.3pp vs 10.7pp）——因为 LF bias 主要 \n      是 stagnation over-prediction，被 gold 纠正后 stagnation class 受冲击最大。\n      \n      三个关键交叉维度：\n      (1) Middle position × conf1 是 performance cliff 的极端区域（structural f1_stag 估计 ~0.52），\n      这恰好也是 human annotators 最不一致的区域——说明这是 intrinsic task difficulty 而非 model \n      缺陷。论文应在 Limitations 中讨论 stagnation detection 的 inherent ambiguity frontier。\n      (2) Probe 的结构性优势区域（LF conflict + cmd_rep-only + high diversity stag）合计 ~25% \n      of gold stagnation samples，且这些区域 probe 优势稳定 (3-7pp)。这不是随机噪声，而是 probe \n      的 semantic signal 在 structural features 的 systematic blind spots 上的 targeted 补充。\n      (3) Resolved vs unresolved 的巨大差距（structural f1_stag 0.90 vs 0.76）提示：当前数据 \n      中 unresolved tasks 的 stagnation 标签 inherently noisier，未来工作可考虑 outcome-aware \n      label model。\n      \n      本分析为 hybrid 推荐提供了 targeted evidence：probe 的增量价值不是统计噪声，而是系统性地 \n      集中在 structural features 的 blind spots。论文的实用建议变为：(a) 部署 structural monitoring \n      作为 primary detector；(b) 在 LF confidence 低的区域叠加 probe 作为 secondary signal；\n      (c) 用 LF confidence 做 alert threshold gating。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"40b3428d-2f1b-4741-a9d4-90a564914a07","total_cost_usd":0.91389575,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":32805,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":27002,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":32805,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":27002,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":32805,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":32805},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},